    q: "Why does it matter that hotels report on USALI?",
    a: "Because a common format makes hotels comparable. Every operator reports the same lines the same way, so an owner can benchmark a hotel against its peers and a buyer or lender can underwrite it quickly. Management agreements rely on it too, defining fees and performance tests with standard terms like total revenue and GOP.",
